Z||000000||kornholio||09-23-1999||10:40 PM||||Howcome no one told me you had to loosen the alternator bracket (I found out in the Haynes manual)??? Stupid me, I kept trying to force the alternator out with it intact. I finally gave up after an hour or so and hooked up the old alternator.  So, if I loosen the alternator bracket tomorrow, I'll be home free right?  How many bolts are there and are they hard to get to?||||reg||5
